stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> CheckingBackend
  CheckingBackend --> CheckingResources
  CheckingResources --> Blocked: admission or disk failure
  CheckingResources --> CheckingModel
  CheckingModel --> Loading: verified artifact present
  CheckingModel --> Queued: download lock held by another operation
  CheckingModel --> Downloading: acquire model lock
  Queued --> Downloading: join or lock available
  Downloading --> Failed: network, integrity or storage failure
  Downloading --> Downloaded: staged artifact verified and atomically published
  Downloaded --> Loading
  Loading --> Failed: runtime load or health failure
  Loading --> Ready: runtime probe and floors pass
  Ready --> Ready: heartbeat and inference
  Ready --> [*]: release, sign out or TTL expiry
  Blocked --> CheckingResources: retry
  Failed --> CheckingBackend: retry
